  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Reviewing Initial Progress**\n\nI\'m pleased to report that the `lint_applet` test passed without any errors. Now, I\'m shifting focus to reviewing the constructed applet and its functionality. The applet strictly enforces the following user JSON schema criteria: a title field, a summary field (short and concise), and a questions field (an array designed for Kahoot-style quiz implementation).\n\n\n"
    modified_response: "T\303\264i \304\221\303\243 ho\303\240n th\303\240nh thi\341\272\277t k\341\272\277 v\303\240 ph\303\241t tri\341\273\203n \341\273\251ng d\341\273\245ng **Kahoot! Quiz Master** - n\341\273\201n t\341\272\243ng t\341\272\241o v\303\240 ch\306\241i game Quiz tr\341\272\257c nghi\341\273\207m t\306\260\306\241ng t\303\241c chu\341\272\251n c\341\272\245u tr\303\272c JSON m\303\240 b\341\272\241n y\303\252u c\341\272\247u.\n\n### \360\237\214\237 T\303\255nh N\304\203ng N\341\273\225i B\341\272\255t & Ki\341\272\277n Tr\303\272c X\341\273\255 L\303\275\n\n- **Chu\341\272\251n C\341\272\245u Tr\303\272c JSON Input Kh\341\272\257t Khe**:\n  - H\341\273\227 tr\341\273\243 \304\221\341\272\247y \304\221\341\273\247 c\303\241c tr\306\260\341\273\235ng `title`, `summary`, v\303\240 danh s\303\241ch `questions` bao g\341\273\223m `id`, `question`, 4 l\341\273\261a ch\341\273\215n `options` (A, B, C, D), `correct_option_id`, `explanation`, `hint`, `difficulty` v\303\240 `time_limit_sec`.\n  - B\341\273\231 ki\341\273\203m tra c\303\272 ph\303\241p (JSON Validator) th\303\264ng b\303\241o chi ti\341\272\277t v\341\273\213 tr\303\255 v\303\240 l\341\273\227i \304\221\341\273\213nh d\341\272\241ng b\341\272\261ng ti\341\272\277ng Vi\341\273\207t n\341\272\277u JSON nh\341\272\255p v\303\240o ch\306\260a h\341\273\243p l\341\273\207.\n- **Tr\341\272\243i Nghi\341\273\207m Ch\306\241i Game Chu\341\272\251n Kahoot!**:\n  - Giao di\341\273\207n 4 bi\341\273\203u t\306\260\341\273\243ng & m\303\240u s\341\272\257c \304\221\341\272\267c tr\306\260ng Kahoot: **Tam gi\303\241c \304\221\341\273\217 (A)**, **H\303\254nh thoi xanh d\306\260\306\241ng (B)**, **H\303\254nh tr\303\262n v\303\240ng (C)**, **H\303\254nh vu\303\264ng xanh l\303\241 (D)**.\n  - \304\220\341\273\223ng h\341\273\223 \304\221\341\272\277m ng\306\260\341\273\243c sinh \304\221\341\273\231ng d\341\272\241ng v\303\262ng SVG, t\303\255nh \304\221i\341\273\203m th\306\260\341\273\237ng ph\341\272\243n x\341\272\241 nhanh & t\303\255ch l\305\251y chu\341\273\227i tr\341\272\243 l\341\273\235i \304\221\303\272ng (Streak Combo).\n  - Tr\341\273\243 gi\303\272p xem g\341\273\243i \303\275 (`hint`) & m\303\240n h\303\254nh hi\341\273\203n th\341\273\213 k\341\272\277t qu\341\272\243 k\303\250m **Gi\341\272\243i th\303\255ch \304\221\303\241p \303\241n** (`explanation`) chi ti\341\272\277t sau m\341\273\227i c\303\242u h\341\273\217i.\n  - T\303\255ch h\341\273\243p b\341\273\231 gi\341\272\243 l\341\272\255p \303\242m thanh Web Audio API (ti\341\272\277ng t\303\255ch t\341\272\257c \304\221\341\272\277m ng\306\260\341\273\243c, chu\303\264ng b\303\241o \304\221\303\272ng, c\303\262i b\303\241o sai, nh\341\272\241c m\341\273\253ng chi\341\272\277n th\341\272\257ng).\n- **\304\220a D\341\272\241ng Ch\341\272\277 \304\220\341\273\231 Ch\306\241i**:\n  - **C\303\241 nh\303\242n (Solo Challenge)**: Th\341\273\255 th\303\241ch c\303\241 nh\303\242n k\341\273\213ch t\303\255nh v\341\273\233i chu\341\273\227i Streak v\303\240 \304\221i\341\273\203m th\306\260\341\273\237ng th\341\273\235i gian.\n  - **Tr\303\254nh chi\341\272\277u (Host Mode)**: Giao di\341\273\207n m\303\240n h\303\254nh l\341\273\233n d\303\240nh cho Gi\303\241o vi\303\252n / Qu\341\272\243n tr\303\262 chi\341\272\277u cho c\341\272\243 l\341\273\233p v\341\273\233i gi\341\272\243 l\341\272\255p Game PIN.\n  - **Si\303\252u t\341\273\221c (Speed Run)**: Th\341\273\235i gian gi\341\272\243m 50%, x2 \304\221i\341\273\203m th\306\260\341\273\237ng ph\341\272\243n x\341\272\241.\n  - **Luy\341\273\207n t\341\272\255p (Practice Mode)**: Kh\303\264ng \304\221\341\272\277m ng\306\260\341\273\243c th\341\273\235i gian, h\341\273\227 tr\341\273\243 m\341\273\237 g\341\273\243i \303\275 t\341\273\261 do.\n- **C\303\264ng C\341\273\245 AI Auto-Generator (Gemini 3.6 Flash)**:\n  - T\341\273\261 \304\221\341\273\231ng t\341\272\241o b\341\273\231 Quiz Kahoot chu\341\272\251n JSON t\341\273\253 b\341\272\245t k\341\273\263 t\303\252n s\341\272\243n ph\341\272\251m, b\303\240i vi\341\272\277t ho\341\272\267c v\304\203n b\341\272\243n m\303\264 t\341\272\243 n\303\240o.\n- **Tr\303\254nh Ch\341\273\211nh S\341\273\255a Tr\341\273\261c Quan & Xu\341\272\245t T\341\273\207p JSON**:\n  - Cho ph\303\251p xem, th\303\252m, s\341\273\255a, x\303\263a c\303\242u h\341\273\217i, \304\221\341\273\225i \304\221\303\241p \303\241n \304\221\303\272ng v\303\240 t\341\272\243i v\341\273\201 t\341\273\207p `.json` \304\221\303\243 ch\341\273\211nh s\341\273\255a.\n  - T\303\255ch h\341\273\243p s\341\272\265n b\341\273\231 Quiz m\341\272\253u (bao g\341\273\223m m\341\272\253u **Sony WH-1000XM5** t\341\273\253 y\303\252u c\341\272\247u c\341\273\247a b\341\272\241n)."
