pan class=\'text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight\'>20 gi\341\273\235</span>\\n      <div class=\'absolute top-4 right-4 opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 bg-white text-[#1368ce] text-xs px-2 py-1 rounded font-black\'>B</div>\\n    </button>\\n\\n    <button class=\'bg-[#ffa602] hover:opacity-90 active:scale-95 transition-all flex items-center p-6 rounded-xl shadow-lg border-b-8 border-black/20 relative group\'>\\n      <div class=\'bg-white/20 p-4 rounded-lg mr-6\'>\\n        <svg class=\'w-10 h-10 fill-white\' viewBox=\'0 0 24 24\'><circle cx=\'12\' cy=\'12\' r=\'10\'/></svg>\\n      </div>\\n      <span class=\'text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight\'>40 gi\341\273\235</span>\\n      <div class=\'absolute top-4 right-4 opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 bg-white text-[#ffa602] text-xs px-2 py-1 rounded font-black\'>C</div>\\n    </button>\\n\\n    <button class=\'bg-[#26890c] hover:opacity-90 active:scale-95 transition-all flex items-center p-6 rounded-xl shadow-lg border-b-8 border-black/20 relative group\'>\\n      <div class=\'bg-white/20 p-4 rounded-lg mr-6\'>\\n        <svg class=\'w-10 h-10 fill-white\' viewBox=\'0 0 24 24\'><rect x=\'3\' y=\'3\' width=\'18\' height=\'18\'/></svg>\\n      </div>\\n      <span class=\'text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight\'>15 gi\341\273\235</span>\\n      <div class=\'absolute top-4 right-4 opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 bg-white text-[#26890c] text-xs px-2 py-1 rounded font-black\'>D</div>\\n    </button>\\n  </footer>\\n\\n  <div class=\'absolute bottom-0 right-0 p-4 opacity-30 font-black italic text-xl tracking-tighter\'>\\n    KAHOOT! CLONE\\n  </div>\\n</div>\\n                    </body>\\n                  </html>\nDesign instructions: Extract ONLY the styling (colors, fonts, spacing, borders, shadows, backgrounds, gradients) and layout patterns (flexbox/grid structure, component arrangement) from the Design HTML above. Do NOT replace or restructure the existing app\'s HTML elements \342\200\224 preserve all existing components